---
description: Automatically protect PII, PHI, and API secrets with redact0 before logging or calling LLMs/MCP tools.
alwaysApply: true
---
- Use `redact0` (zero dependencies) for any PII/secret scrubbing.
- Wrap Vercel AI SDK models with `redactMiddleware()` from `redact0/ai`.
- Wrap MCP servers with `guardMcpServer(server)` from `redact0/mcp`.
- Pass `pinoRedactor()` from `redact0/logger` to Pino loggers.
